==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|24px]] '''Silk CubicCurve 4''' command creates a parametric Bézier cubic curve, a CubicCurve_4 object, from a [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|4 point polygon]] or a [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4_segment.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4_segment|4 point segment polygon]].

[[File:2.-CubicCurve_4.png|300px]]

{{Caption|A 3D Bézier curve built from a ControlPoly4_2N object}}

These curves are used as [[Silk_Workbench#Primary_Curves|primary curves]] to visualize the edges of primary surfaces and as [[Silk_Workbench#Curve_Segments|curve segments]] controlling the layout of sub-surfaces on a primary surface.

